        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-01-17T04:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m digging it.  I took EvilWayne’s awesome trackers and added info like the hero’s hp total, their on-card power, and on the back, their three incapacitated powers.  Now, you can use these on the table in front of you instead of needing the hero’s actual card.  Thanks EvilWayne!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5b899e3d889041ea1a7bb0b3aa7e9c14bfd3d328.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/5b899e3d889041ea1a7bb0b3aa7e9c14bfd3d328\" title=\"sotm_tracker.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5b899e3d889041ea1a7bb0b3aa7e9c14bfd3d328_2_690x425.jpeg\" alt=\"sotm_tracker.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"d3Mij58J3l8q0jebL9gW1guVhmU\" width=\"690\" height=\"425\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5b899e3d889041ea1a7bb0b3aa7e9c14bfd3d328_2_690x425.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5b899e3d889041ea1a7bb0b3aa7e9c14bfd3d328_2_1035x637.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5b899e3d889041ea1a7bb0b3aa7e9c14bfd3d328.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5b899e3d889041ea1a7bb0b3aa7e9c14bfd3d328_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">sotm_tracker.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">1101×679 101 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
