        "created_at": "2012-01-18T03:07:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Bwah! That’s…  :o wow. I <span class=\"bbcode-b\">so</span> wish I had the time and inclination to do this. Any chance you will be able to post the other heroes?  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Many thanks to <span class=\"bbcode-b\">both</span> of you!</p>\n<p>Rabit</p>",
