        "created_at": "2012-01-19T04:13:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Spiff&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Spiff\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m digging it.  I took EvilWayne’s awesome trackers and added info like the hero’s hp total, their on-card power, and on the back, their three incapacitated powers.  Now, you can use these on the table in front of you instead of needing the hero’s actual card.  Thanks EvilWayne!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Man, that is pretty sweet. I love the idea of just flipping it over when you’re dead.</p>",
